/* ---- pictures that ended up on the wrong piece ----
   The WordPress library reused file names (image.png, image-3.png), so one
   upload could land in four unrelated posts: an eel's migration diagram sat
   on top of a love poem, and the lobster essay carried a map of the Near
   East and a statue of Prithvi Narayan. The originals are gone with the old
   site, so each wrong picture is either removed, swapped for the one that
   does belong to the piece, or replaced with a drawing made for it. */
